plaintext
* SPICE Netlist for the schematic

* Voltage sources
VDD 5 0 DC 20V
VIN 1 0

* PMOS Transistor
M1 4 4 5 5 PMOS L=1u W=1u

* NMOS Transistor
M2 4 3 2 2 NMOS L=1u W=1u

* Resistors
RD 5 4 10k
RDS 4 2 50

* Output
VOUT 4 0

* Models
.model PMOS PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-1)
.model NMOS NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=1)

.END